---
description: List workflows available in the catalog (with readiness)
---

```bash
curl -s "{{ backend_base_url }}/api/workflow-catalog?project_id={{ project.id }}"
```

For each workflow template, render: `workflow_id | name | stage count | all_deps_met (yes/no) | already_added (yes/no)`. If `deps_unmet` is non-empty, list the missing prerequisite stage_ids — those need to be `complete` somewhere in the project before this workflow can be added meaningfully.

Read-only.
